# Never publish the flag generator or anything derived from it.
# tools/gen-ctf-constants.py holds the only plaintext copy of the flags and
# the sudo password, and it lives outside this repo on purpose. These patterns
# are a second line of defence in case it is ever copied in by accident.
gen-ctf-constants.py
ctf-constants.json
flags.json
*.secrets.json
